        <item>
            <title>1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:41:21 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
The first public release of OpenVocally.

- Hold a shortcut, speak and release: OpenVocally transcribes on your Mac and pastes the text into the app you are using.
- Local speech models: Parakeet v3, Parakeet Ultra and Whisper Turbo.
- Transcripts history, stats on Home, and a recording indicator in the notch or as a floating island.
- Signed with Developer ID and notarized by Apple. Updates install from GitHub, signed with an EdDSA key.

Requires a Mac with Apple Silicon and macOS 15 or newer.
]]></description>
